# Continue the one CinderDeep game

Use main and projects/cinderdeep-3d. Read AGENTS.md (here and at the repository root), README.md and 3D-PLAN.md.
Run python3 ../../tools/check_active_version.py. The game already exists: edit src/, run npm run build and npm test.
Do not recreate it, continue an archived branch, or initialize upstream submodules.
